  "title": "Grilled Pollo a la Brasa",
  "description": "You need to plan ahead for pollo a la brasa because the chicken has to marinate for 8 to 24 hours. This flavorful chicken recipe comes from Peru.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
